  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Key Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the fundamental components. Specifically, I\'m building `src/components/CambodiaEmblem.tsx`, aiming for a zero-image-break vector SVG based on official Cambodian government styling. I\'ll include the lotus, open book of wisdom, pen, and golden kbach ornaments.\n\n\n**Defining Top-Bar Elements**\n\nI\'m now outlining the top bar contract for the application, breaking it into three distinct zones. Zone 1 will feature the wordmark/logo in Khmer. Navigation links, including \"Dashboard\", \"Outgoing Letters\", \"Incoming Letters\", \"Reports\", and \"Settings\" will populate Zone 2. Finally, Zone 3 will house primary action buttons for letter creation, printing, and sync status.\n\n\n**Designing Filter Interactions**\n\nI\'m currently designing the filter bar, focusing on a user-friendly experience. I\'m adding a search input for live text filtering across summary, recipient, and remarks. I\'m implementing year and month filters, date ranges, and a reset button. I\'m also including \"Add Outgoing letter,\" \"Print preview,\" and \"Export CSV\" buttons.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nMy focus is on a reactive table design now. I\'m implementing the five requested columns: \"\341\236\233.\341\236\232,\" \"\341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\233\341\236\271\341\236\230\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217 \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 \341\236\201\341\237\202 \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206,\" \"\341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223,\" \"\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\236\275\341\236\204\341\236\221\341\236\221\341\236\275\341\236\233,\" and \"\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227.\"  I\'ve decided on a compact hover action menu for edit, delete, and view details. Column 2 will neatly display the letter summary with the date right below.\n\n\n**Defining Incoming Views**\n\nI\'m now outlining the structure of the incoming letters view, starting with an official Khmer book header. I\'m focusing on the filter bar with its powerful controls. I\'m also implementing a specific 5-column table that\'s designed exactly as requested, and will be including compact action icons, for edit, delete and view controls. This is my next step in this stage of development.\n\n\n**Developing Modal Interactions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on incoming letter modal interactions and print preview design. I\'m building `src/components/IncomingLetterModal.tsx` with fields for the next sequential number, letter content, original ministry, quantity, and date. The print preview in `src/components/PrintPreviewModal.tsx` will be a fullscreen/modal view, mirroring the official print layout.\n\n\n**Refining Print Interactions**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on fine-tuning the print preview controls. I\'ve added toggles for A4/A5 paper sizes and landscape/portrait orientations. I\'ve included a toggle to include the national header, plus options for the institution\'s name and department. I\'m also implementing a cover page toggle and am finalizing the print and download options. I\'m ensuring the 5-column table renders precisely with correct ratios, print styles, and page breaks. Also, I\'m starting on the settings view.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_565236"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface Props {\\n  className?: string;\\n  size?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CambodiaEmblem: React.FC<Props> = ({ className = \'w-12 h-12\', size = 48 }) => {\\n  return (\\n    <svg\\n      width={size}\\n      height={size}\\n      viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\"\\n      fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n      xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"\\n      className={className}\\n      aria-label=\\\"Cambodia Education Emblem\\\"\\n    >\\n      {/* Outer Decorative Circle with Gold Border */}\\n      <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"46\\\" fill=\\\"#F8FAFC\\\" stroke=\\\"#B45309\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"2.5\\\" />\\n      <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" r=\\\"42\\\" fill=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\" stroke=\\\"#D97706\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\" strokeDasharray=\\\"2 2\\\" />\\n\\n      {/* Radiant Sunburst Rays */}\\n      <g stroke=\\\"#F59E0B\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"1.2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\">\\n        <line x1=\\\"50\\\" y1=\\\"12\\\" x2=\\\"50\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"50\\\" y1=\\\"82\\\" x2=\\\"50\\\" y2=\\\"88\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"50\\\" x2=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"50\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"82\\\" y1=\\\"50\\\" x2=\\\"88\\\" y2=\\\"50\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"23\\\" y1=\\\"23\\\" x2=\\\"28\\\" y2=\\\"28\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"72\\\" y1=\\\"72\\\" x2=\\\"77\\\" y2=\\\"77\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"23\\\" y1=\\\"77\\\" x2=\\\"28\\\" y2=\\\"72\\\" />\\n        <line x1=\\\"72\\\" y1=\\\"28\\\" x2=\\\"77\\\" y2=\\\"23\\\" />\\n      </g>\\n\\n      {/* Lotus Pedestal Petals */}\\n      <path\\n        d=\\\"M26 68 C 34 60, 42 66, 50 64 C 58 66, 66 60, 74 68 C 66 74, 34 74, 26 68 Z\\\"\\n        fill=\\\"#DC2626\\\"\\n        stroke=\\\"#991B1B\\\"\\n        strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n      />\\n      <path\\n        d=\\\"M32 71 C 38 67, 44 69, 50 68 C 56 69, 62 67, 68 71 C 60 76, 40 76, 32 71 Z\\\"\\n        fill=\\\"#B91C1C\\\"\\n      />\\n\\n      {/*