  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Print Layout**\n\nI\'m now diving into building `src/components/PrintPreviewModal.tsx`. I\'m meticulously reviewing the print layout requirements, especially focusing on sections 1, 2, 5, 6, 7, and 11 to ensure a robust solution that preserves the specified print layout criteria. I\'m focusing on \"\341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\216\341\236\273\341\236\205\341\236\237\341\237\206\341\236\201\341\236\266\341\236\223\341\237\213\341\236\224\341\237\206\341\236\225\341\236\273\341\236\217\341\237\226 Print Layout \341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\274\341\236\234\341\236\232\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\221.\"\n\n\n**Defining Print Layout Details**\n\nI\'m now concretely defining the print layout specifics for outgoing and incoming letters. I\'m structuring the output as a booklet format based on user input, and laying out the letter\'s essential information, from date ranges and totals to structured tables with key fields like content, quantities, and recipient information. I am also working through the A4 and A5 paper sizes, and I will be using Print CSS to hide unnecessary elements.\n\n\n**Refining Print Preview Features**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the user interface elements for print preview. Specifically, I\'m defining the controls bar within `PrintPreviewModal.tsx`. It will offer switches for book type (outgoing/incoming) and paper size (A4/A5), and a toggle for orientation (landscape/portrait). This UI will only be visible in screen mode, hidden when printing. I am meticulously adhering to the requirement to preserve the defined book formats: 5 columns for both outgoing and incoming letters. I\'m taking Section 10\'s settings into account for the print header too.\n\n\n**Designing Print Controls**\n\nI\'m now designing the controls for the print preview. I\'ve added a few toggles to show/hide the Kingdom header with the institution seal, switch between Khmer and Latin digits, and include the official book cover page. I\'ve included direct print and close preview buttons for user convenience. I\'m prioritizing landscape for the five columns, but portrait will also be supported.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_716325"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React, { useState, useMemo } from \'react\';\\nimport { OutgoingLetter, IncomingLetter, SystemSettings } from \'../types\';\\nimport { calculateBookHeader, toKhmerNum, padNumber } from \'../utils/khmerNumerals\';\\nimport { CambodiaEmblem } from \'./CambodiaEmblem\';\\nimport { Printer, X, FileText, Check, Settings2, BookOpen } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface Props {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  type: \'outgoing\' | \'incoming\';\\n  outgoingLetters: OutgoingLetter[];\\n  incomingLetters: IncomingLetter[];\\n  settings: SystemSettings;\\n}\\n\\nexport const PrintPreviewModal: React.FC<Props> = ({\\n  isOpen,\\n  onClose,\\n  type: initialType,\\n  outgoingLetters,\\n  incomingLetters,\\n  settings,\\n}) => {\\n  const [bookType, setBookType] = useState<\'outgoing\' | \'incoming\'>(initialType);\\n  const [paperSize, setPaperSize] = useState<\'A4\' | \'A5\'>(settings.paperSize || \'A4\');\\n  const [orientation, setOrientation] = useState<\'landscape\' | \'portrait\'>(settings.orientation || \'landscape\');\\n  const [showOfficialHeader, setShowOfficialHeader] = useState<boolean>(settings.showOfficialHeader);\\n  const [useKhmerDigits, setUseKhmerDigits] = useState<boolean>(settings.useKhmerDigits);\\n  const [includeCoverPage, setIncludeCoverPage] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [fontSize, setFontSize] = useState<number>(settings.fontSizePt || 11);\\n\\n  // Sync initial type when opening\\n  React.useEffect(() => {\\n    setBookType(initialType);\\n  }, [initialType, isOpen]);\\n\\n  // Active records sorted by sequential number\\n  const activeRecords = useMemo(() => {\\n    if (bookType === \'outgoing\') {\\n      return [...outgoingLetters].sort((a, b) => a.recordNumber - b.recordNumber);\\n    } else {\\n      return [...incomingLetters].sort((a, b) => a.recordNumber - b.recordNumber);\\n    }\\n  }, [bookType, outgoingLetters, incomingLetters]);\\n\\n  // Calculate header dynamically\\n  const headerInfo = useMemo(() => {\\n    return calculateBookHeader(activeRecords, useKhmerDigits);\\n  }, [activeRecords, useKhmerDigits]);\\n\\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\\n\\n  const handlePrint = () => {\\n    window.print();\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 overflow-y-auto bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xs flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n      {/* Top Floating Control Bar (Hidden when printing via .no-print) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"no-print sticky top-0 z-50 w-full bg-white border-b border-slate-200 shadow-md px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n        {/* Left: Book Switcher */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-lg\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setBookType(\'outgoing\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                bookType === \'outgoing\'\\n                  ? \'bg-amber-700 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              \341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\237\201\341\236\211\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setBookType(\'incoming\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                bookType === \'incoming\'\\n                  ? \'bg-blue-700 text-white shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              \341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\236\274\341\236\233\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500 pl-2\\\">\\n            <span>{activeRecords.length} \341\236\200\341\237\206\341\236\216\341\236\217\341\237\213\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\266</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Center: Print Options */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n          {/* Paper Size */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-lg\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setPaperSize(\'A4\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                paperSize === \'A4\' ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs\' : \'text-slate-600\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              A4\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setPaperSize(\'A5\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                paperSize === \'A5\' ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs\' : \'text-slate-600\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              A5\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Orientation */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-lg\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setOrientation(\'landscape\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                orientation === \'landscape\' ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs\' : \'text-slate-600\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              \341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\237\201\341\236\200 (Landscape)\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setOrientation(\'portrait\')}\\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors ${\\n                orientation === \'portrait\' ? \'bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-xs\' : \'text-slate-600\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              \341\236\224\341\236\211\341\237\222\341\236\210\341\236\232 (Portrait)\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Header Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setShowOfficialHeader(!showOfficialHeader)}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-medium transition-colors ${\\n              showOfficialHeader\\n                ? \'bg-amber-50 border-amber-300 text-amber-900\'\\n                : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-600\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {showOfficialHeader ? \'\342\234\223 \341\236\224\341\236\213\341\236\230\341\236\200\341\236\220\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\212\341\237\222\341\236\213\' : \'\341\236\224\341\236\213\341\236\230\341\236\200\341\236\220\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\212\341\237\222\341\236\213\'}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Khmer Numerals Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setUseKhmerDigits(!useKhmerDigits)}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-medium transition-colors ${\\n              useKhmerDigits\\n                ? \'bg-amber-50 border-amber-300 text-amber-900\'\\n                : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-600\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {useKhmerDigits ? \'\342\234\223 \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\230\341\237\202\341\236\232 (\341\237\240-\341\237\251)\' : \'\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\242\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\237\211\341\236\266\341\236\224\341\237\213 (0-9)\'}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Cover Page Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setIncludeCoverPage(!includeCoverPage)}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border text-xs font-medium transition-colors ${\\n              includeCoverPage\\n                ? \'bg-amber-50 border-amber-300 text-amber-900\'\\n                : \'bg-white border-slate-200 text-slate-600\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {includeCoverPage ? \'\342\234\223 \341\236\221\341\237\206\341\236\226\341\237\220\341\236\232\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\224\341\236\230\341\236\273\341\236\201\' : \'+ \341\236\221\341\237\206\341\236\226\341\237\220\341\236\232\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\224\341\236\230\341\236\273\341\236\201\'}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right: Print & Close Buttons */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={handlePrint}\\n            className=\\\"px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Printer size={15} />\\n            <span>\341\236\224\341\237\204\341\237\207\341\236\226\341\236\273\341\236\230\341\237\222\341\236\226\341\236\245\341\236\241\341\236\274\341\236\234\341\236\223\341\237\201\341\237\207 (Print)</span>\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X size={18} />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Printable Paper Canvas */}\\n      <div className=\\\"py-8 px-4 w-full flex justify-center printable-area\\\">\\n        <div\\n          className={`bg-white shadow-2xl print:shadow-none text-black mx-auto transition-all ${\\n            paperSize === \'A4\'\\n              ? orientation === \'landscape\'\\n                ? \'w-[297mm] min-h-[210mm]\'\\n                : \'w-[210mm] min-h-[297mm]\'\\n              : orientation === \'landscape\'\\n              ? \'w-[210mm] min-h-[148mm]\'\\n              : \'w-[148mm] min-h-[210mm]\'\\n          } p-8 sm:p-12 print:p-0 print:m-0`}\\n          style={{ fontSize: `${fontSize}pt` }}\\n        >\\n          {/* ================= OPTIONAL BOOK COVER PAGE ================= */}\\n          {includeCoverPage && (\\n            <div\\n              className=\\\"border-4 border-double border-slate-900 p-8 sm:p-12 min-h-[90%] flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center mb-12\\\"\\n              style={{ pageBreakAfter: \'always\' }}\\n            >\\n              {/* National Motto */}\\n              <div>\\n                <CambodiaEmblem size={70} className=\\\"mx-auto mb-3\\\" />\\n                <h2 className=\\\"font-moul text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-900 tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  \341\236\226\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\237\207\341\236\232\341\236\266\341\236\207\341\236\266\341\236\216\341\236\266\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\200\341\236\230\341\237\222\341\236\226\341\236\273\341\236\207\341\236\266\\n                </h2>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"font-moul text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 tracking-widest mt-1\\\">\\n                  \341\236\207\341\236\266\341\236\217\341\236\267 \341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\237\341\236\223\341\236\266 \341\236\226\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\237\207\341\236\230\341\236\240\341\236\266\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232\\n                </h3>\\n                <div className=\\\"w-24 h-0.5 bg-slate-900 mx-auto mt-2\\\"></div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Institution Details */}\\n              <div className=\\\"my-8 space-y-2\\\">\\n                <p className=\\\"font-moul text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-900\\\">\\n                  {settings.institutionName}\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800\\\">\\n                  {settings.departmentName}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Cover Title */}\\n              <div className=\\\"my-10 py-6 px-10 border-2 border-slate-900 inline-block bg-slate-50/50\\\">\\n                <h1 className=\\\"font-moul text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-slate-900 tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  {bookType === \'outgoing\' ? \'\341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\205\341\236\273\341\237\207\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\237\201\341\236\211\' : \'\341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\205\341\236\273\341\237\207\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\236\274\341\236\233\'}\\n                </h1>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-semibold mt-3\\\">\\n                  \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206 {useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(settings.currentYear) : settings.currentYear}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Cover Metadata Range */}\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 font-medium\\\">\\n                <p>\\n                  \341\236\205\341\236\266\341\236\224\341\237\213\341\236\226\341\236\270\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201 <strong>{headerInfo.fromNumberStr}</strong> \341\236\212\341\236\233\341\237\213\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201 <strong>{headerInfo.toNumberStr}</strong>\\n                </p>\\n                <p>\\n                  {headerInfo.fromDateStr} \341\236\212\341\236\233\341\237\213 {headerInfo.toDateStr}\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2\\\">\\n                  \341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223\341\236\237\341\236\232\341\236\273\341\236\224\341\237\226 <strong>{useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(headerInfo.totalCount) : headerInfo.totalCount}</strong> \341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Footer */}\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 pt-6\\\">\\n                {settings.address && <span>{settings.address} \302\267 </span>}\\n                {settings.phone && <span>\341\236\221\341\236\274\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\237\220\341\236\226\341\237\222\341\236\221\341\237\226 {settings.phone}</span>}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* ================= REGISTER BOOK MAIN PAGE ================= */}\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n            {/* Optional Official National Header */}\\n            {showOfficialHeader && (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-200\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-left\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-moul text-xs text-slate-900\\\">{settings.institutionName}</p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-700\\\">{settings.departmentName}</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-moul text-xs text-slate-900\\\">\341\236\226\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\237\207\341\236\232\341\236\266\341\236\207\341\236\266\341\236\216\341\236\266\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\200\341\236\230\341\237\222\341\236\226\341\236\273\341\236\207\341\236\266</p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-moul text-[11px] text-slate-800\\\">\341\236\207\341\236\266\341\236\217\341\236\267 \341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\237\341\236\223\341\236\266 \341\236\226\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\237\207\341\236\230\341\236\240\341\236\266\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {/* Official Book Title (Strictly as specified) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"text-center space-y-1\\\">\\n              <h1 className=\\\"font-moul text-lg sm:text-2xl text-slate-900 tracking-wide\\\">\\n                {bookType === \'outgoing\' ? \'\341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\205\341\236\273\341\237\207\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\237\201\341\236\211\' : \'\341\236\237\341\237\200\341\236\234\341\236\227\341\237\205\341\236\205\341\236\273\341\237\207\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\236\274\341\236\233\'}\\n              </h1>\\n\\n              {/* Header Number and Date calculations strictly as required */}\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-900\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"font-semibold tracking-wide\\\">\\n                  \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201 <span className=\\\"underline decoration-slate-900 px-1 font-bold\\\">{headerInfo.fromNumberStr}</span> \341\236\212\341\236\233\341\237\213\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201 <span className=\\\"underline decoration-slate-900 px-1 font-bold\\\">{headerInfo.toNumberStr}</span> \341\236\237\341\236\232\341\236\273\341\236\224 <span className=\\\"underline decoration-slate-900 px-1 font-bold\\\">{useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(headerInfo.totalCount) : headerInfo.totalCount}</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-medium\\\">{headerInfo.fromDateStr}</span> \341\236\212\341\236\233\341\237\213 <span className=\\\"font-medium\\\">{headerInfo.toDateStr}</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* STRICT 5-COLUMN TABLE */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n              {bookType === \'outgoing\' ? (\\n                /* OUTGOING TABLE (Strict 5 Columns) */\\n                <table className=\\\"w-full border-collapse border border-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-[11pt]\\\">\\n                  <thead>\\n                    <tr className=\\\"bg-slate-100 font-moul text-center text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-900\\\">\\n                      {/* Column 1 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[8%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\233.\341\236\232\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 2 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-3 w-[44%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\233\341\236\271\341\236\230\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217 \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 \341\236\201\341\237\202 \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 3 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[10%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 4 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-3 w-[22%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\236\275\341\236\204\341\236\221\341\236\221\341\236\275\341\236\233\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 5 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[16%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227\\n                      </th>\\n                    </tr>\\n                  </thead>\\n                  <tbody>\\n                    {activeRecords.length === 0 ? (\\n                      <tr>\\n                        <td colSpan={5} className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-8 text-center text-slate-400\\\">\\n                          \341\236\202\341\237\222\341\236\230\341\236\266\341\236\223\341\236\221\341\236\267\341\236\223\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\223\341\237\220\341\236\231\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\237\201\341\236\211\\n                        </td>\\n                      </tr>\\n                    ) : (\\n                      (activeRecords as OutgoingLetter[]).map((row) => {\\n                        const dayStr = String(row.day).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n                        const monthStr = String(row.month).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n                        const dateStr = `\341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 ${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(dayStr) : dayStr} \341\236\201\341\237\202 ${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(monthStr) : monthStr} \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206 ${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(row.year) : row.year}`;\\n                        const numStr = padNumber(row.recordNumber, 3, useKhmerDigits);\\n\\n                        return (\\n                          <tr key={row.id} className=\\\"align-top border-b border-slate-900\\\">\\n                            {/* 1. \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\232\341\237\200\341\236\204 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-center font-bold tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              {numStr}\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 2. \341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\233\341\236\271\341\236\230\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217 \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 \341\236\201\341\237\202 \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-3 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"font-normal text-slate-900\\\">{row.summary}</div>\\n                              <div className=\\\"text-[10pt] text-slate-700 italic mt-1\\\">\\n                                {dateStr}\\n                              </div>\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 3. \341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-center tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              {useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(row.quantity) : row.quantity}\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 4. \341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\236\275\341\236\204\341\236\221\341\236\221\341\236\275\341\236\233 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-3\\\">\\n                              {row.recipientMinistry}\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 5. \341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-slate-700 text-[10pt]\\\">\\n                              {row.remarks || \'\'}\\n                            </td>\\n                          </tr>\\n                        );\\n                      })\\n                    )}\\n                  </tbody>\\n                </table>\\n              ) : (\\n                /* INCOMING TABLE (Strict 5 Columns) */\\n                <table className=\\\"w-full border-collapse border border-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-[11pt]\\\">\\n                  <thead>\\n                    <tr className=\\\"bg-slate-100 font-moul text-center text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-900\\\">\\n                      {/* Column 1 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[8%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\233.\341\236\232\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 2 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-3 w-[42%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\233\341\236\271\341\236\230\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217 \341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\236\275\341\236\204\341\236\212\341\236\276\341\236\230\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 3 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[10%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 4 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-3 w-[24%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\212\341\236\276\341\236\230 \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 \341\236\201\341\237\202 \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206\\n                      </th>\\n                      {/* Column 5 */}\\n                      <th className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2.5 px-2 w-[16%] text-center align-middle\\\">\\n                        \341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227\\n                      </th>\\n                    </tr>\\n                  </thead>\\n                  <tbody>\\n                    {activeRecords.length === 0 ? (\\n                      <tr>\\n                        <td colSpan={5} className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-8 text-center text-slate-400\\\">\\n                          \341\236\202\341\237\222\341\236\230\341\236\266\341\236\223\341\236\221\341\236\267\341\236\223\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\223\341\237\220\341\236\231\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\205\341\236\274\341\236\233\\n                        </td>\\n                      </tr>\\n                    ) : (\\n                      (activeRecords as IncomingLetter[]).map((row) => {\\n                        const dayStr = String(row.day).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n                        const monthStr = String(row.month).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n                        const dateStr = `\341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 ${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(dayStr) : dayStr}/${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(monthStr) : monthStr}/${useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(row.year) : row.year}`;\\n                        const numStr = padNumber(row.recordNumber, 3, useKhmerDigits);\\n\\n                        return (\\n                          <tr key={row.id} className=\\\"align-top border-b border-slate-900\\\">\\n                            {/* 1. \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\232\341\237\200\341\236\204 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-center font-bold tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              {numStr}\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 2. \341\236\201\341\237\222\341\236\233\341\236\271\341\236\230\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217 \341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\237\341\236\275\341\236\204\341\236\212\341\236\276\341\236\230 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-3 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"font-normal text-slate-900\\\">{row.summary}</div>\\n                              <div className=\\\"text-[10pt] text-slate-800 font-semibold mt-1\\\">\\n                                \341\236\226\341\236\270\341\237\226 {row.senderMinistry}\\n                              </div>\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 3. \341\236\205\341\237\206\341\236\223\341\236\275\341\236\223 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-center tabular-nums\\\">\\n                              {useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(row.quantity) : row.quantity}\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 4. \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\233\341\236\267\341\236\201\341\236\267\341\236\217\341\236\212\341\236\276\341\236\230 \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270 \341\236\201\341\237\202 \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-3\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"font-medium\\\">\\n                                \341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\237\226 {row.originalLetterNumber || \'\341\236\202\341\237\222\341\236\230\341\236\266\341\236\223\'}\\n                              </div>\\n                              <div className=\\\"text-[10pt] text-slate-700 italic mt-0.5\\\">\\n                                {dateStr}\\n                              </div>\\n                            </td>\\n\\n                            {/* 5. \341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\212\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227 */}\\n                            <td className=\\\"border border-slate-900 py-2 px-2 text-slate-700 text-[10pt]\\\">\\n                              {row.remarks || \'\'}\\n                            </td>\\n                          </tr>\\n                        );\\n                      })\\n                    )}\\n                  </tbody>\\n                </table>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Official Cambodian Verification / Endorsement Signatures at the bottom */}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-8 grid grid-cols-2 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-900\\\" style={{ pageBreakInside: \'avoid\' }}>\\n              <div>\\n                <p className=\\\"font-moul text-xs\\\">\341\236\224\341\236\266\341\236\223\341\236\203\341\236\276\341\236\211 \341\236\223\341\236\267\341\236\204\341\236\257\341\236\200\341\236\227\341\236\266\341\236\226</p>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-semibold\\\">{settings.departmentName || \'\341\236\224\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\222\341\236\266\341\236\223\341\236\200\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\267\341\236\231\341\236\266\341\236\233\341\237\220\341\236\231\'}</p>\\n                <div className=\\\"h-16\\\"></div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-slate-500 text-xs\\\">(\341\236\240\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\220\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\266 \341\236\223\341\236\267\341\236\204\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\266)</p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div>\\n                <p>\\n                  \341\236\220\341\237\222\341\236\204\341\237\203\341\236\221\341\236\270............ \341\236\201\341\237\202............ \341\236\206\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\266\341\237\206 {useKhmerDigits ? toKhmerNum(settings.currentYear) : settings.currentYear}\\n                </p>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-1 font-semibold\\\">\341\236\242\341\237\222\341\236\223\341\236\200\341\236\200\341\236\217\341\237\213\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\232\341\236\266</p>\\n                <div className=\\\"h-16\\\"></div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-slate-500 text-xs\\\">(\341\236\240\341\236\217\341\237\222\341\236\220\341\236\233\341\237\201\341\236\201\341\236\266 \341\236\223\341\236\267\341\236\204\341\236\210\341\237\222\341\236\230\341\237\204\341\237\207)</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/PrintPreviewModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating print preview modal\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create official print preview modal with strict 5-column layout\"}"
