  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating the modal component**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `IncomingLetterModal.tsx` file. I\'m adding `attachmentUrl`, `attachmentName`, and `attachmentType` state to the component. My goal is to integrate these into the `handleSubmit` function and then incorporate an `<AttachmentField />` component right after the Remarks input to reflect these new functionalities.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
