  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising UI Display**\n\nI\'m currently focused on updating the `LetterDetailModal.tsx` component. The goal is to integrate the attachment display immediately following the \"\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\205\341\236\200\341\237\222\341\236\217\341\236\270\341\236\225\341\237\222\341\236\237\341\237\201\341\236\204\341\237\227\" section. Specifically, if a `letter.attachmentUrl` is present, I\'ll render a card showcasing the file icon or thumbnail, filename, and type. A \"\341\236\224\341\236\276\341\236\200\341\236\230\341\236\276\341\236\233\341\236\257\341\236\200\341\236\237\341\236\266\341\236\232\341\236\227\341\237\222\341\236\207\341\236\266\341\236\224\341\237\213 (Open Attachment)\" button will provide direct access to the file.\n\n\n"
